{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"0c4bb12f540726db","type":"text","text":"[[The Strife Emperor, Bane.canvas]]. God of war and conquest. He is a lawful evil God who is pure evil but believes in hierarchy. In the War he was the main of Evil forces to combat against the Prime deities until he was pushed back and nearly killed by Pelor the dawn father who at the time already slew the form of Tiamat and entrapped Asmodeus.\n\n[[Lord of the Hells, Asmodeus.canvas]]. God of domination, torture and the ruler of the nine hells. He was the only God in the war to strike a defining blow on Pelor but he paid gravely for it. Being left to rot in a domain of Pelor's creation to be tortured eternally. His followers ensue chaos wherever they go and are nearly all torturers. His dominion over the hells has created a massive army which he hopes to one day unleash on the world now that the Gods have left mortals to fend for themselves.\n\n[[The Blood Drinker, Bhaal.canvas]]. God of Murder and slaughter. His followers and known for being heinous people who want nothing but senseless psychotic death with no remorse. Because of his insanity he was not able to do much in the war as Bane kept him off the battlefield due to his unpredictability. \n\n[[The Scaled Tyrant, Tiamat.canvas]]. Queen of chromatic dragons and Goddess of greed, envy, hoarded wealth and evil-aligned dragons. Her followers are evil dragon born who will stop at nothing but the destruction of Draconia, although small in numbers they are forever plotting. Since her defeat by Pelor she has become the weakest among the betrayer Gods and is a fraction of her former self only now alive in spirit. In the calamity she was killed by Pelor and her role was mass destruction.\n\n[[The Spider Queen, Lolth.canvas]]. Goddess of deceit, shadows and spiders. Evil beyond compare, wanting to rule over everything. Her followers are all dark elves but not all follow her. The ones who follow her are consumed with madness and do not act of their own will, they are merely puppets for her to toy with. Her influence in the war was to try at every waking hour to peer into and take over the minds of the prime deities. In secret Iuon constantly blocked her attempts and never allowed her to complete her task. \n\n[[Lady of Loss, Shar.canvas]]. Goddess of Darkness and lady of loss. Evil but calculated, Shar wants dominion over people and she will get it by spreading lies and corruption. Followers of Shar believe all other Gods heretics, furthermore her followers renounce magic, if a mage is found they will be burnt, hanged or worse.\n\n[[The fleeting whisper, Killaris.canvas]]. A fallen God killed by the Ever Light. He once ruled over the domain of secrets and necromancy. Although scarce his followers do exist, mainly evil wizards who practice Necromancy. His most profound Follower was the Whispered One who sought to beseech his throne but was “Killed by Caesar”. Now Killaris’s throne is vacant and evil wizards since the calamity have tried to claim it.","x":-740,"y":-400,"width":1360,"height":620},
		{"id":"a189fd649d38fcd9","type":"text","text":"[[Gods.base]]\n#Betrayer ","x":-900,"y":-640,"width":250,"height":60}
	],
	"edges":[]
